  "name": {
    "zh": "mos_雨滴",
    "en": "mos_rain"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "真实的雨天玻璃：细密水雾铺底，大小不一的水珠，少量贯穿画面的蜿蜒水流；水流上串着大水珠，靠近的水珠会融成不规则水洼。带色散、锐高光、暗轮廓与磨砂。",
    "en": "Rain on a window: fine mist, beads of mixed sizes, and a few winding streams across the frame. Beads sit on the streams, and nearby beads merge into irregular puddles. Dispersion, sharp highlights, dark contours and frost."
  },
